+// jtrefon TBQ blocks (ids 58/59). Taken-from: jtrefon/llama.cpp-turboq-mtp@6a02d0494 (ggml-common.h).
+// 3.125 bpw: 128-element block, signed FWHT rotation, 3-bit Lloyd-Max indices in 24-bit lanes
